@machiyag If you are on the stable, beta or alpha update channel, updating now will return the problem for you.

If you are on the Nightly channel, yes, updating will be OK.  

Alternatively, you can stay on the channel you have been on before but, manually install the current nightly:  https://github.com/NightscoutFoundation/xDrip/releases/tag/2022.12.09
